# L §2.2 Built-in ids: "the built-in indexes days months years bank_account"; L §4.1 "A quarter ... is a value,
# never a key: an index's period kinds are day, month and year". The built-in index quarters is gone (writer 8), so
# an input keyed by it names no index: LOAD-NAME.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input amt[q in quarters]: money PLN

ask a: 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME ...
